5608       data Enzyme;
5609       input Concentration Velocity @@;
5610       datalines;

NOTE: SAS went to a new line when INPUT statement reached past the end of a line.
NOTE: The data set WORK.ENZYME has 14 observations and 2 variables.

5618       ;
5619       proc nlin data=Enzyme method=marquardt hougaard;
5620       parms theta1=155
5621       theta2=0 to 0.07 by 0.01;
5622       model Velocity = theta1*Concentration / (theta2 + Concentration);
5623       run;

NOTE: DER.theta1 not initialized or missing. It will be computed automatically.
NOTE: DER.theta2 not initialized or missing. It will be computed automatically.
NOTE: Convergence criterion met.
NOTE: The PROCEDURE NLIN printed pages 379-380.

